      "person_id": "war_qdw_fs5",
      "source_quote": "辟議曹從事參軍、廬陵王法曹行參軍。",
      "reading": "議曹從事參軍後為廬陵王法曹行參軍。該任在齊，未書年或王名。卷四十有廬陵王子卿，卷五十又有建武元年封廬陵郡王的寶源，兩人並列待定。",
      "note": "議曹從事參軍後為廬陵王法曹行參軍。該任在齊，未書年或王名。卷四十有廬陵王子卿，卷五十又有建武元年封廬陵郡王的寶源，兩人並列待定。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 128,
      "end_codepoint": 145,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence2-145",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "war_qdw_fs5",
      "source_quote": "天監初，爲右軍安成王外兵參軍，轉主簿。",
      "reading": "梁天監初入安成王府任外兵參軍、轉主簿。安成康王秀本傳在天監三年進號右將軍。",
      "note": "梁天監初入安成王府任外兵參軍、轉主簿。安成康王秀本傳在天監三年進號右將軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 145,
      "end_codepoint": 164,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence3-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "倕與樂安任昉友善，爲《感知己賦》以贈昉，昉因此名以報之曰：",
      "reading": "陸倕先以賦贈樂安任昉，傳文以下引的是任昉同題答賦。類聚所存陸倕原贈另見固定文本。",
      "note": "陸倕先以賦贈樂安任昉，傳文以下引的是任昉同題答賦。類聚所存陸倕原贈另見固定文本。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 29,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "「信偉人之世篤，本侯服於陸鄉。",
      "reading": "任昉以陸家世系及陸鄉開篇，陸鄉屬地稱。",
      "note": "任昉以陸家世系及陸鄉開篇，陸鄉屬地稱。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 15,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-15",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "緬風流與道素，襲袞衣與繡裳。",
      "reading": "承上言家風與袞服。殿本「緬風流於道素」。",
      "note": "承上言家風與袞服。殿本「緬風流於道素」。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 15,
      "end_codepoint": 29,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-29",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "還伊人而世載，並三駿而龍光。",
      "reading": "並稱三駿；南史另明述慧曉三子僚、任、倕，人稱三陸。這一句未逐一指名。",
      "note": "並稱三駿；南史另明述慧曉三子僚、任、倕，人稱三陸。這一句未逐一指名。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 29,
      "end_codepoint": 43,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-43",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "過龍津而一息，望鳳條而曾翔。",
      "reading": "以龍津鳳條形容騰舉；殿本會翔。",
      "note": "以龍津鳳條形容騰舉；殿本會翔。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 43,
      "end_codepoint": 57,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-57",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "彼白玉之雖潔，此幽蘭之信芳。",
      "reading": "以白玉、幽蘭比潔與芳。",
      "note": "以白玉、幽蘭比潔與芳。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 57,
      "end_codepoint": 71,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-71",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "思在物而取譬，非鬥斗之能量。",
      "reading": "言度量不能盡其才。固定文「鬥斗」，殿本「斗斛」。",
      "note": "言度量不能盡其才。固定文「鬥斗」，殿本「斗斛」。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 71,
      "end_codepoint": 85,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-85",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "匹聳峙於東岳，比凝厲於秋霜。",
      "reading": "以東岳、秋霜況其高峻嚴整。",
      "note": "以東岳、秋霜況其高峻嚴整。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 85,
      "end_codepoint": 99,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-99",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "不一飯以妄過，每三錢以投渭。",
      "reading": "一飯、三錢為賦中行誼之喻。",
      "note": "一飯、三錢為賦中行誼之喻。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 99,
      "end_codepoint": 113,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-113",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "匪蒙袂之敢嗟，豈溝壑之能衣。",
      "reading": "以蒙袂、溝壑申說處困。",
      "note": "以蒙袂、溝壑申說處困。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 113,
      "end_codepoint": 127,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-127",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "旣蘊藉其有餘，又淡然而無味。",
      "reading": "稱其藴藉而淡然。",
      "note": "稱其藴藉而淡然。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 127,
      "end_codepoint": 141,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-141",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "得意同乎卷懷，違方似乎仗氣。",
      "reading": "卷懷、仗氣兩端並言。",
      "note": "卷懷、仗氣兩端並言。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 141,
      "end_codepoint": 155,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-155",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "類平叔而靡雕，似子雲之不樸。",
      "reading": "平叔、子雲是被比者，係於何晏、揚雄；與贈答雙方分列。",
      "note": "平叔、子雲是被比者，係於何晏、揚雄；與贈答雙方分列。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 155,
      "end_codepoint": 169,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-169",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "冠衆善而貽操，綜羣言而名學。",
      "reading": "接前句稱陸氏綜合群言。",
      "note": "接前句稱陸氏綜合群言。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 169,
      "end_codepoint": 183,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-183",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "折高、戴於后臺，異鄒、顏乎董幄。",
      "reading": "高、戴、鄒、顏等姓為論學譬喻，此句未寫名字。",
      "note": "高、戴、鄒、顏等姓為論學譬喻，此句未寫名字。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 183,
      "end_codepoint": 199,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-199",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "采三《詩》於河間，訪九師於淮曲。",
      "reading": "河間與淮曲為古地與學術傳統的指稱。",
      "note": "河間與淮曲為古地與學術傳統的指稱。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 199,
      "end_codepoint": 215,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-215",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "術兼口傳之書，藝廣鏗鏘之樂。",
      "reading": "兼提口授與音樂。",
      "note": "兼提口授與音樂。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 215,
      "end_codepoint": 229,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-229",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "時坐睡而梁懸，裁枝梧而錐握。",
      "reading": "述懸梁與握錐的勸學意象。",
      "note": "述懸梁與握錐的勸學意象。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 229,
      "end_codepoint": 243,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-243",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "旣文過而意深，又理勝而辭縟。",
      "reading": "文意、理辭相發。",
      "note": "文意、理辭相發。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 243,
      "end_codepoint": 257,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-257",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "咨余生之荏苒，迫歲暮而傷情。",
      "reading": "「余」轉指答賦作者任昉自道歲暮。",
      "note": "「余」轉指答賦作者任昉自道歲暮。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 257,
      "end_codepoint": 271,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-271",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "測徂陰於堂下，聽鳴鐘於洛城。",
      "reading": "堂下日影、洛城鳴鐘寫光陰。",
      "note": "堂下日影、洛城鳴鐘寫光陰。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 271,
      "end_codepoint": 285,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-285",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "唯忘年之陸子，定一遇於班荊。",
      "reading": "忘年之陸子為受答的陸倕。",
      "note": "忘年之陸子為受答的陸倕。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 285,
      "end_codepoint": 299,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-299",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "余獲田蘇之價，爾得海上之名。",
      "reading": "任昉自比受知，爾指陸倕。殿本「爾等」，數位「爾得」。",
      "note": "任昉自比受知，爾指陸倕。殿本「爾等」，數位「爾得」。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 299,
      "end_codepoint": 313,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-313",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "信落魄而無產，終長對於短生。",
      "reading": "任昉言無產、長短之生，未載生卒年。",
      "note": "任昉言無產、長短之生，未載生卒年。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 313,
      "end_codepoint": 327,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-327",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "饑虛表于徐步，逃責顯於疾行。",
      "reading": "徐步疾行各以飢乏、逃責釋之。",
      "note": "徐步疾行各以飢乏、逃責釋之。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 327,
      "end_codepoint": 341,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-341",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "子比我於叔則，又方余於耀卿。",
      "reading": "子指倕，我與余指昉。叔則與裴楷字相合；耀卿未有足以定人的別證。",
      "note": "子指倕，我與余指昉。叔則與裴楷字相合；耀卿未有足以定人的別證。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 341,
      "end_codepoint": 355,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-355",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "心照情交，流言靡惑。",
      "reading": "兩人相知，不為流言所惑。",
      "note": "兩人相知，不為流言所惑。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 355,
      "end_codepoint": 365,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-365",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "萬類暗求，千里懸得。",
      "reading": "以千里懸得言彼此相知。殿本「闇求」。",
      "note": "以千里懸得言彼此相知。殿本「闇求」。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 365,
      "end_codepoint": 375,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-375",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "言象可廢，蹄筌自默。",
      "reading": "言象與蹄筌同為傳意之具。",
      "note": "言象與蹄筌同為傳意之具。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 375,
      "end_codepoint": 385,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-385",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "居非連棟，行則同車。",
      "reading": "居雖異，出則同車。",
      "note": "居雖異，出則同車。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 385,
      "end_codepoint": 395,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-395",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "冬日不足，夏日靡餘。",
      "reading": "冬夏以喻相處。",
      "note": "冬夏以喻相處。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 395,
      "end_codepoint": 405,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-405",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "肴核非餌，絲竹豈娛。",
      "reading": "肴核、絲竹在此說交友之樂。",
      "note": "肴核、絲竹在此說交友之樂。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 405,
      "end_codepoint": 415,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-415",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "我未舍駕，子已回輿。",
      "reading": "我指任昉，子指陸倕，二人分乘輿駕。",
      "note": "我指任昉，子指陸倕，二人分乘輿駕。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 415,
      "end_codepoint": 425,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luchui-complete:received_sentence4-425",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "tvc_q3c_t7w",
      "source_quote": "中飯相顧，悵然動色。",
